炶韩鍋氬嚖鍑颁簡銆傗��", "瀛ｆ睙褰辨洸鎸囨懇鎸插ス鐨勮劯棰婏紝杩欐牱鍐锋儏鐨勭敺浜猴紝閭�鑲嗚捣鏉ヤ究鏍煎�栭瓍鎯戙�傜溂瑙掓媺寰楀緢闀匡紝杩樺井寰�涓婃壃锛岃�佺瑧涓嶇瑧鐨勶紝濡栧�戒竴鑸�銆�", "瀹夊瓙鏋愭湰鏉ヤ竴鑵旀�ㄥ康锛屽捊鍦ㄥ績鍙ｉ偅閲屾定婊′簡锛屾槰鏅氳繕鐪嬪埌瀛ｆ睙褰变翰鍚诲ス鈥︹�︽�ゅ埢鑴镐竴绾�锛屾棤澹扮殑浣庝笅澶淬�傚崐鏅屾墠璇达細鈥滀粖鏅氬幓鎴戦偅閲屽惂銆傗��"], "_garbled": false, "novel_title": "重生之豪门悍女", "content_zh": "春风第一流 （007）顾浅凝的金主季江然将下巴抵到她的脖颈中，装出乖顺的模样。“不要客气，尽管吃掉啊。季家人怎么了，你知道季家的男人有多抢手，谁有你这么好命，会有季公子自动送上门来。”抚她的脸颊静静摩挲，有一下没一下的：“颜如玉怎么你了？连我都跟着一起迁怒了。”顾浅凝拿胳膊肘儿膛开他，转过身去背对他：“你那个未婚妻了不得，假惺惺，耍花枪，哪一样她不是炉火纯青。怎么？说你未婚妻你不高兴？”季江然已经调整好姿势重新腻上来揽着她。笑了声：“我这是心疼她么，我明显更心疼你。”手臂缠到她的腰上。又问她；“你是不是没有零用钱了？给你的副卡怎么不用？”顾浅凝除了吃喝，几乎用不到什么钱。没用查询卡里余额，也不知道还有多少钱。问他：“怎么这样问？”“没见你买什么衣服，妆也不化，难不成连买化妆品的钱都没有了？你以前不是就热衷这些？”顾浅凝了然，听闻这个顾二千金以前是个花枝招展的人，每天喜欢浓妆艳抹。由其钟爱奢侈品，衣服很少穿重样，包包也是轮翻上阵。她和顾浅凝的品味完全不搭，首先衣服不喜艳色，花样也不要太过时髦百出。所以只在衣服上添置了几件，平时不见什么人，就很少买了。至于包包还用她那些，知名品牌，大部分都是崭新的，拿出去一点儿不寒碜。化妆品也是，柜子里有的是新品，连封都没有拆，正好拿过来用。只是没想到，顾浅凝这样一个大小姐，以前还要从季二少这里拿钱来用。顾浅凝无不讽刺的说：“这样一想，我们不仅是这样，原来你还是我的大老板。”季江然飘飘说：“要说得这么难听么？你是我的女人，供养你不是我应尽的义务。再说，就顾家给你那几个微薄的零花钱我不补给你，只怕会让你饿肚子。”顾浅凝好奇起来，顾家人每月到底给顾浅凝多少钱值当她饿肚子？“以后的补给季二少还是免了吧，我这样的草包一定没办法还你。至于这个房子，算我租住你的，等我找到新的住处，再还给你。”时间不早了，实在困得难受。催促他：“我要睡了，你快走吧。指望这个偿还，那还是算了。”季江然没动弹，须臾就听到她均匀的呼吸声。试探着叫了两声果然是睡了。忽然好笑，这个女人既不想跟他上床，又不怕他将人强了。到底有多大的能耐，竟然连一点儿防备都没有。不禁喃喃：“顾浅凝，你到底是谁？”顾浅凝醒得很早，季江然一定不在。他没有在这里过夜的习惯，也是，暗度陈仓这种事不信他不加倍小心。心情好，所以换上动运装出去跑步。天气很好，阳光浓郁却并不灼热，别墅区的绿化面积大，虫鸣鸟叫，一片欣欣向荣。跑步的时候想起来，要去查询一下卡上余额，看看这个顾浅凝何故要向季二少伸手要钱花。给自己做了丰盛的早餐，吃完之后出门。提款机上的数字显示并不乐观，没想到顾浅凝的生活光鲜亮丽，存款还远不及她的多。不到五万块，听顾夫人说顾家两个未嫁女儿的生活费及零用钱都是按月打进卡里来的。这样一看，一个月似乎真的不多，一万多。这对于一个普通的女孩子来说，或许可以活，但顾浅凝一个追求时尚的拜金女，不饿肚子才怪。难怪要向季二少伸手要。莫非跟季江然的地下关系就是这么构建出来的？顾浅凝打电话给顾夫人要求一起逛街，让顾夫人没想到。张口问她：“是不是没钱花了，不会是想让我给你刷卡吧？”顾浅凝打消她的顾虑：“妈，你想多了，我卡上的钱足够用。”顾夫人不可思议，觉得是在骗她。顾浅凝是月光族，每个月卡里空空，私下里让她救济不是一次两次了。直到顾浅凝承诺见了面让她看余额，才将顾虑打消，可是上午没时间，约好下午一起。顾浅凝没再返回别墅，眼见到中午了，直接在外面吃中饭。不想在西餐厅碰到季江然和他的女伴。季家两公子，在整个江远城排名前三，名副其实的冠盖满京华。招女人的程度就像招蚂蚁的蜜糖，又都风流成性，经手的女人个个漂亮。两人似乎用完餐，正从厅门里出来。门童周到的替他们将门打开。顾浅凝就在这时迎头走过来，这样乍眼，早就看到了。戴着的墨镜没摘下，摭住大半张脸，打一旁走过去。一侧手臂忽然被季江然握紧，似笑非笑：“这么大一双眼睛没看到我从里面出来？”顾浅凝摘掉墨镜，无辜的笑了声：“哦，季二少，好巧。”季江然先转首对女伴说：“先到车上等我。”女人很听话，点点头先走了。季江然拉着顾浅凝重新返回西餐厅里。“来吃饭？”顾浅凝好笑；“要不然来洗澡？”“怎么变得伶牙俐齿的？”顾浅凝问他；“不是吃完了？跟进来干什么？你女伴还在等你呢。”季江然回头瞪了她一眼；“怎么这么没良心？吃什么，我来替你买单。”顾浅凝已经笑得合不拢嘴：“季二少，我虽然没什么钱，但是一顿饭还是吃得起的。不用你好心。”季江然抿了下嘴角：“我到底哪里招惹你了？非得撇清关系是不是？顾浅凝，没你这么做人的。”顾浅凝一伸手，扯着他的领带将人拉近。“季江然，你不会喜欢我？”季江然怔了下，邪气的笑起来；“宝贝儿，我当然喜欢你。我不喜欢你，喜欢谁。”顾浅凝媚眼如斯的笑起来：“季二少，你至今为止，没动一万个女人说过这样的话，也有一千了吧？”一伸手推开他：“用这话回去讨好你的小情人吧，别影响我吃饭。”", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/chongshengzhihaomenhannu/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The Best Spring Breeze (007) Gu Qianning's financial sponsor, Ji Jiangran, put his chin into her neck, pretending to be obedient. \"You're welcome, just eat it. What's wrong with the Ji family? Do you know how popular the men of the Ji family are? Whoever is as lucky as you will have Mr. Ji come to your door automatically.\" He caressed her cheek quietly and asked, \"Yan Ruyu, what's wrong with you? Even I'm following you.\" Angry.\" Gu Qianning opened him with her elbow and turned her back to him: \"Your fiancée is so pretentious and tricksy. What's wrong with her? Are you unhappy about your fiancée?\" Ji Jiangran had already adjusted his posture and hugged her again. He laughed and said, \"Do I feel sorry for her? I obviously feel sorry for you more.\" His arms wrapped around her waist. He asked her again, \"Do you have no pocket money? Why don't you use the secondary card I gave you?\" Gu Qianning hardly needs any money except for food and drink. There is no need to check the balance in the card, and I don’t know how much money is left. Asked him, \"Why do you ask that?\" \"I didn't see you buying any clothes or putting on makeup. Could it be that you don't even have the money to buy cosmetics? Weren't you keen on these things before?\" Gu Qianning understood. She heard that Gu Erqianjin used to be a showy person and liked to wear heavy makeup every day. Because of his love for luxury goods, he rarely wears the same clothes and keeps his bags in rotation. Her and Gu Qianning's tastes are completely different. First of all, they don't like colorful clothes, and they don't want to be too fashionable. So I only added a few pieces to my clothes. I rarely bought them when I didn’t see anyone. As for the bags she uses, they are well-known brands and most of them are brand new, so they don’t look shabby at all. The same goes for cosmetics. There are many new products in the cabinet, and the seals have not even been opened. They are just in time to be used. I just didn't expect that a young lady like Gu Qianning would take money from Second Young Master Ji. Gu Qianning said sarcastically: \"Think about it this way, we are not just like this, you are also my big boss.\" Ji Jiangran said flutteringly: \"Do you want to say it so harshly? You are my woman, and it is not my obligation to support you. Besides, if I don't replenish the meager pocket money the Gu family gives you, I'm afraid you will starve.\" Gu Qianning became curious, how much money does the Gu family give Gu Qianning every month, is it worth it for her to starve? \"Young Master Ji will have to waive the supply for you in the future. There's no way I can pay you back for a loser like me. As for this house, let me rent it to you. I'll give it back to you when I find a new place to live.\" It's getting late, and I feel really sleepy. Urging him: \"I'm going to sleep, please leave quickly. If you expect this to be repaid, forget it.\" Ji Jiangran didn't move, and he heard her even breathing for a moment. After calling twice tentatively, he fell asleep. Suddenly it was funny. This woman didn't want to sleep with him, but she wasn't afraid of him raping her. How capable he is, yet he doesn't even have the slightest bit of defense. She couldn't help but murmur: \"Gu Qianning, who are you?\" Gu Qianning woke up very early, Ji Jiangran must not be there. He didn't have the habit of spending the night here, and he wouldn't be more careful if he didn't trust Chen Cang secretly. I was in a good mood, so I put on my sportswear and went out for a run. The weather is very good, the sunshine is strong but not scorching. The villa area has a large green area, insects and birds are chirping, and everything is thriving. While running, I remembered to check the balance on the card to see why Gu Qianning wanted to ask Second Young Master Ji for money. I made myself a hearty breakfast and went out after eating. The numbers on the cash machine were not optimistic. Unexpectedly, Gu Qianning's life was bright and glamorous, and her savings were far less than hers. It’s less than 50,000 yuan. I heard from Mrs. Gu that the living expenses and pocket money for the two unmarried daughters of the Gu family are paid into the card on a monthly basis. Looking at it this way, a month does not seem to be much, more than 10,000. For an ordinary girl, this might be possible, but for Gu Qianning, a money-worshiping girl who pursues fashion, it would be strange if she didn't go hungry. No wonder he wanted to ask for it from Second Young Master Ji. Could it be that this is how the underground relationship with Ji Jiangran was built? Gu Qianning called Mrs. Gu and asked to go shopping together, which surprised Mrs. Gu. He opened his mouth and asked her, \"Do you have no money to spend? Do you want me to swipe your card?\" Gu Qianning dismissed her concerns: \"Mom, you are overthinking. The money on my card is enough.\" Mrs. Gu was in disbelief and felt that she was being lied to. Gu Qianning was from the Moonlight Clan, and every month her credit card was empty, so she asked her for relief in private more than once or twice. It wasn't until Gu Qianning promised to meet her to see her balance that she gave up her worries. But she didn't have time in the morning and made an appointment to meet in the afternoon. Gu Qianning did not return to the villa. Seeing that it was noon, she went directly to eat lunch outside. He didn't want to meet Ji Jiangran and his female companion in a western restaurant. The two young masters of the Ji family are ranked among the top three in the entire Jiangyuan City, and they are worthy of their reputation and dominate the capital. He recruits women like honey to ants, and they are all romantic, and all the women he handles are beautiful. The two seemed to have finished their meal and were coming out of the hall door. The doorman thoughtfully opened the door for them. Gu Qianning walked over at this moment, and she had already seen it at first glance. Without taking off the sunglasses he was wearing, he covered most of his face and walked over. One arm was suddenly clenched by Ji Jiangran, half-smiling: \"With such big eyes, you didn't see me coming out?\" Gu Qianning took off her sunglasses and laughed innocently: \"Oh, Second Young Master Ji, what a coincidence.\" Ji Jiangran first turned to his female companion and said, \"Wait for me in the car first.\" The woman was very obedient, nodded and left first. Ji Jiangran took Gu Qianning back to the western restaurant. \"Come to eat?\" Gu Qianning was funny; \"Or come to take a shower?\" \"How did you become so sharp-tongued?\" Gu Qianning asked him; \"Didn't you finish eating? Why did you follow me? Your girlfriend is still waiting for you.\" Ji Jiangran turned around and glared at her; \"Why are you so heartless? I'll pay for whatever you eat.\" Gu Qianning was already laughing from ear to ear: \"Ji Er", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}